msgid "A password is required for this protocol."
msgstr "此协议必须填写密码。"
msgid "Choose a local file or paste node links. Nothing is sent until Preview is pressed."
msgstr "请选择本地文件或粘贴节点链接；点击预览前不会发送任何内容。"
msgid "Manage the local SOCKS and HTTP Xray listeners."
msgstr "管理本机的 Xray SOCKS 和 HTTP 监听入口。"
msgid "Only non-sensitive node properties are shown in this list."
msgstr "此列表仅显示非敏感的节点属性。"
msgid "Raw outbound JSON must be a valid JSON object with a protocol."
msgstr "原始出站 JSON 必须是包含 protocol 的有效 JSON 对象。"
msgid "Reality is supported only for structured VLESS nodes; use protocol=raw."
msgstr "Reality 仅支持结构化 VLESS 节点；其他情况请使用 protocol=raw。"
msgid "Reality with this transport is unsupported; use protocol=raw."
msgstr "此传输方式不支持 Reality；请使用 protocol=raw。"
msgid "SOCKS username and password must be supplied together."
msgstr "SOCKS 用户名和密码必须同时填写。"
msgid "The active node cannot be deleted while XC is enabled. Switch nodes first."
msgstr "XC 启用时不能删除当前节点，请先切换节点。"
msgid "The final 256 KiB of the XC runtime log is shown. Sensitive values are redacted before logging."
msgstr "此处显示 XC 运行日志的最后 256 KiB；敏感值在写入日志前会被脱敏。"
msgid "The node update could not be staged safely."
msgstr "无法安全地暂存节点更新。"
msgid "The only enabled node cannot be deleted while XC is enabled. Disable XC first."
msgstr "XC 启用时不能删除唯一启用的节点，请先停用 XC。"
msgid "The runtime derives this address from network.lan and falls back to 127.0.0.1."
msgstr "运行时从 network.lan 获取此地址，失败时回退到 127.0.0.1。"
msgid "The selected node is invalid."
msgstr "所选节点无效。"
msgid "This flow requires TCP; use protocol=raw for other combinations."
msgstr "此流控要求 TCP；其他组合请使用 protocol=raw。"
msgid "This structured encryption is unsupported; use protocol=raw."
msgstr "不支持此结构化加密配置；请使用 protocol=raw。"
msgid "Use a complete Xray outbound JSON object for uncommon or unsupported combinations."
msgstr "对于不常见或不支持的组合，请使用完整的 Xray 出站 JSON 对象。"
